OL,3,GNEWSACommunity raises thousands for
OL,4,Astorm-hit family farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe co-owner of a storm-hit farm says
OL,7,Fthe community's response to a
OL,8,Ffundraiser has been "completely
OL,9,Foverwhelming".
OL,11,FThe pony shelter, play area and hutches
OL,12,Fat Porter's Farm in Portland, Dorset,
OL,13,Fwere damaged by Storm Austen, which
OL,14,Fbrought gusts of 75mph to the island,
OL,15,Flast Friday.
OL,17,FA fundraiser set up by a family friend
OL,18,Fhas raised more than #5,000, which will
OL,19,Fbe used to replace the pony shelter and
OL,20,Fbuild a new play area.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
