OL,3,GNEWSACommunity raises thousands for
OL,4,Astorm-hit family farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FLee Porter, who runs the farm with his
OL,7,Fwife, Charlotte, said: "We never dreamt
OL,8,Fthat we would get anywhere near the
OL,9,Famount that's raised.
